  first: `scripts/release-entry.sh into` does it, both on the author's Mac after
  `make release-local` and in the workflow of a tag. That line is how the entry finds its
  place, so it stays.

  The address may never change — every installed copy looks for its updates there:
      https://EvgenyBaulin.github.io/ohmymoney/appcast.xml

  Pages must publish from a branch that holds this file and nothing else — a Pages site
  served from `main` would publish the whole repository over HTTP.
-->
